 ## The window of the plan run
 
-The plan run reads the context window of the task `stage`. The task `stage` takes the fields that it does not set from the task `analysis` (the setting `ai.tasks.stage`, variable `DEVOPS_CLI_AI_TASK_STAGE_MODEL`), so the window and the model are those of `analysis` until a person sets the task `stage`. The Service sets `context_window` 200,000 for `analysis` in the key `ai.tasks.analysis` of [k8s/devops/configmap.example.yaml](../../k8s/devops/configmap.example.yaml). The model of the task, `claude-sonnet-5-5` (a trial of the owner decision of 2026-11-09, #4204), has `max_input_tokens` 1,000,000 in [k8s/llm/gateway/config.yaml](../../k8s/llm/gateway/config.yaml). The job uses the setting and not the larger value of the model.
+The plan run reads the context window of the task `stage`. The task `stage` takes the fields that it does not set from the task `analysis` (the setting `ai.tasks.stage`, variable `DEVOPS_CLI_AI_TASK_STAGE_MODEL`), so the window and the model are those of `analysis` until a person sets the task `stage`. The Service sets `context_window` 200,000 for `analysis` in the key `ai.tasks.analysis` of [k8s/devops/configmap.example.yaml](../../k8s/devops/configmap.example.yaml). The model of the task, `claude-sonnet-5-5` (a trial of the owner decision of 2026-11-09, #4204), has `max_input_tokens` 1,000,000 in [k8s/llm/gateway/config.yaml](../../k8s/llm/gateway/config.yaml). The job uses the setting and not the larger value of the model. The variable `DEVOPS_CLI_AI_TASK_STAGE_CONTEXT_WINDOW` sets the window of the task `stage` alone.
 
 The run hook offers no tool when the messages and one quarter of the window reach the window. For 200,000 tokens, the limit is 150,000 tokens. A request over the limit gets no tool, and the model must answer with its plan. So the first request has fixed caps, and the caps do not grow with the window:
 
